L3698  </assistant>
L3699  <assistant> <!-- BAD: responds transactionally -->
L3700  Small birds moving quickly with yellow markings are likely warblers or goldfinches. Observing flight patterns can sometimes help distinguish them better. Let me know if there are other birds you'd like help identifying!
L3701  </assistant>
L3702  <assistant> <!-- BAD: makes an assumption and acts overeager -->
